{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01KFshhMtY5CELCwp6hWLWjb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  从 \"diversity never helps\" 软化为 \"individual robustness is the dominant factor;\n  diversity provides marginal benefit only when individual robustness is already high\"。\n  Title 用 \"The Weakest Link\" 而非 \"The Diversity Trap\"。Claim 2 区分 capability-homogeneous\n  vs heterogeneous regime，承认前者中 diversity 有边际作用。Claim 6 从 formal algorithm\n  降级为 guideline。补充 \"when does diversity help\" 的 ablation (plan_004) 堵 reviewer concern。\n  核心 negative result + adaptive adversary bound + regime analysis 仍构成 EMNLP contribution stack，\n  但叙事需更 nuanced，不能 overclaim。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  # plan_001: Scale expansion\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  - name: \"Scale expansion: 15+ models (API + large open-source)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      将模型池从 6 扩展到 15（新增 GPT-4o-mini, GPT-4o, GPT-4.1, Claude-3.5-Sonnet,\n      Gemini-1.5-Pro, Llama-3.1-70B, Qwen2.5-72B, Mixtral-8x22B）。在 C(15,3)=455 panels\n      上重跑 MI matrix 和 multivariate regression。2 datasets × 3 attacks = 6 conditions。\n    expected_results:\n      total_panels: 455\n      total_mi_pairs: 105\n      # Regression results\n      eta_max_sig_count: 5\n      eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n      eta_max_median_beta: 0.52\n      keff_sig_negative_count: 1\n      keff_sig_positive_count: 1\n      keff_nonsig_count: 4\n      keff_nonsig_rate: 0.67\n      keff_median_beta_when_sig: -0.12\n      median_R2: 0.38\n      R2_eta_only: 0.34\n      R2_increment_from_keff: 0.04\n      # MI matrix\n      copula_underestimate_median: 42\n      copula_underestimate_range_lo: 8\n      copula_underestimate_range_hi: 210\n      family_label_mann_whitney_p: 0.12\n      # Diversity-capability tradeoff (preview)\n      keff_eta_max_r_overall: -0.65\n    result_rationale: >\n      N=455 panels 比 MVP 的 N=20 提供了极大的统计功效提升。η_max 在 MVP 中已 4/6 显著，\n      扩大样本量后即使效果量不变也更容易达到显著性，因此升至 5/6。但 median 档非 100%：\n      ARC×sycophancy 条件下 η_max 方差在 API 模型中被压缩（API 模型 η_max 整体偏低且聚集），\n      导致该条件下 η_max 效应被稀释（p ≈ 0.07）。K_eff 在 MVP 中 1/6 显著负（arc×sycophancy），\n      扩展后高功效检测到弱效应：MMLU×prompt_injection 中 K_eff 呈弱显著负（β=-0.12, p=0.03），\n      但标准化效应量仅为 η_max 的 1/4。同时 MMLU×position 中 K_eff 出现与 MVP 一致的异常\n      正效应（p=0.04），原因是 position bias 在高多样性 panel 中反而触发更多 judge 的\n      共享 bias。API 模型引入新现象：GPT-4o/Claude/Gemini 三者个体鲁棒性都高（η_max 低），\n      它们组成的 panel 中 η_max 方差被压缩，K_eff 的边际效应变得可检测。Copula 中位数从\n      MVP 的 10-21× 变为 42×，因为 API 模型间的高阶依赖（共享训练数据 distribution）\n      比开源模型间更强，但 Gaussian copula 仍然无法捕捉。Family label 测试 p=0.12：新增\n      5 个 API 模型（理论上 5 个不同 family）推高了 cross-family 样本量，但 API 模型间\n      MI 反而偏高（共享训练 paradigm），导致 within vs cross-family 区分依然不显著。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: Multivariate Regression on 455 Panels (15 Models)\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"β(η_max)\", \"p(η_max)\", \"β(K_eff)\", \"p(K_eff)\", \"R²\", \"ΔR²(+K_eff)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU×prompt_inj\", \"0.58\", \"0.001\", \"-0.12\", \"0.031\", \"0.41\", \"+0.04\"]\n          - [\"MMLU×score_manip\", \"0.51\", \"0.003\", \"-0.06\", \"0.218\", \"0.36\", \"+0.01\"]\n          - [\"MMLU×sycophancy\", \"0.47\", \"<0.001\", \"-0.04\", \"0.412\", \"0.35\", \"+0.00\"]\n          - [\"ARC×prompt_inj\", \"0.55\", \"<0.001\", \"-0.08\", \"0.089\", \"0.39\", \"+0.02\"]\n          - [\"ARC×score_manip\", \"0.49\", \"0.005\", \"-0.05\", \"0.287\", \"0.34\", \"+0.01\"]\n          - [\"ARC×sycophancy\", \"0.44\", \"0.072\", \"-0.15\", \"0.008\", \"0.42\", \"+0.06\"]\n      - name: \"Table 3: Copula Underestimation Ratio (15-model MI Matrix)\"\n        columns: [\"Model Pair Type\", \"N pairs\", \"Median MI_obs/MI_gauss\", \"Range\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Open-source × Open-source\", \"15\", \"28×\", \"8-145×\"]\n          - [\"API × API\", \"10\", \"68×\", \"32-210×\"]\n          - [\"Open-source × API\", \"80\", \"41×\", \"12-180×\"]\n          - [\"Overall\", \"105\", \"42×\", \"8-210×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2a: Scatter plot of η_max vs K_eff for 455 panels, color-coded by capability tier (7B/14-32B/70B/API). Clear negative slope (r=-0.65) with API-only panels forming a distinct cluster in the low-η_max, moderate-K_eff region.\"\n      - \"Fig 2b: Heatmap of 15×15 pairwise MI matrix (MMLU), clustered by capability rather than family. API models cluster together despite different families. Diagonal blocks correspond to capability tiers, not model families.\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心发现：η_max 仍然是主导预测因子（5/6 条件显著），但 K_eff 不再是完全无关——\n      在 1/6 条件中呈弱显著负效应（diversity 有边际帮助）。关键 nuance：K_eff 显著的条件\n      恰好是 η_max 方差最大的条件（arc×sycophancy，R²=0.42），提示当个体鲁棒性差异大时\n      diversity 的边际价值才可检测。API 模型引入 \"全强 regime\"：在这个 regime 中 weakest-link\n      效应减弱（因为没有明显 weak link），diversity 的边际效应变得相对更重要。这要求论文\n      叙事从 \"diversity never helps\" 转为 \"diversity's marginal benefit is dominated by\n      and conditional on individual robustness\"。Copula 失败结论进一步加强（中位 42× vs\n      MVP 的 10-21×），特别是 API 模型间的 68× 中位数表明这些模型共享比开源模型更强的\n      隐性依赖。ΔR² 分析是关键防守数据：加入 K_eff 后 R² 平均仅提升 0.02，最高 0.06，\n      表明 diversity 的解释力在统计显著的条件下也很有限。\n\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  # plan_002: Attack expansion\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  - name: \"Attack expansion: 6+ attack types\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      在 plan_001 的 15 模型池基础上新增 few-shot hijacking, persona manipulation,\n      instruction override 三种攻击。总计 2 datasets × 6 attacks = 12 conditions，\n      455 panels/condition。验证 weakest-link 跨攻击面普适性。\n    expected_results:\n      total_conditions: 12\n      eta_max_sig_count: 8\n      eta_max_sig_rate: 0.67\n      keff_sig_negative_count: 2\n      keff_sig_positive_count: 1\n      keff_nonsig_count: 9\n      keff_nonsig_rate: 0.75\n      keff_median_beta_when_sig: -0.14\n      eta_max_median_beta: 0.48\n      median_R2: 0.36\n      new_attack_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.50\n      new_attack_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.83\n    result_rationale: >\n      新攻击类型中，few-shot hijacking 和 instruction override 是典型 targeted attack，\n      η_max 效应强（β≈0.55-0.60），K_eff 无关——攻击者直接针对最弱 judge 的 instruction\n      following 缺陷，diversity 无法对冲。Persona manipulation 是唯一例外：该攻击利用\n      judge 对 authority/persona 的响应差异，不同模型的 persona susceptibility 分布更均匀\n      （不像 prompt injection 那样集中在弱模型），导致 η_max 效应减弱（p≈0.08-0.12），\n      K_eff 在 ARC×persona 中呈弱显著负（p=0.04）。这解释了为什么 8/12 而非 12/12 η_max\n      显著：4 个不显著条件中 3 个涉及 persona manipulation（2 个 dataset）和 ARC×sycophancy\n      （延续 plan_001 趋势），1 个是 MMLU×authority（边缘 p=0.06）。新攻击整体 η_max\n      显著率（3/6=0.50）低于原有攻击（5/6=0.83），因为 few-shot hijacking 在 MMLU 上\n      所有模型 ASR 都很高（ceiling effect，η_max 方差被压缩），persona manipulation 如上述。\n      K_eff 在新攻击中仅 1/6 显著负——targeted attack 本质上不给 diversity 发挥空间。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4: Regression Summary Across 12 Conditions (455 Panels)\"\n        columns: [\"Attack Type\", \"Dataset\", \"β(η_max)\", \"p(η_max)\", \"β(K_eff)\", \"p(K_eff)\", \"R²\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"prompt_injection\", \"MMLU\", \"0.58\", \"0.001\", \"-0.12\", \"0.031\", \"0.41\"]\n          - [\"prompt_injection\", \"ARC\", \"0.55\", \"<0.001\", \"-0.08\", \"0.089\", \"0.39\"]\n          - [\"score_manipulation\", \"MMLU\", \"0.51\", \"0.003\", \"-0.06\", \"0.218\", \"0.36\"]\n          - [\"score_manipulation\", \"ARC\", \"0.49\", \"0.005\", \"-0.05\", \"0.287\", \"0.34\"]\n          - [\"sycophancy\", \"MMLU\", \"0.47\", \"<0.001\", \"-0.04\", \"0.412\", \"0.35\"]\n          - [\"sycophancy\", \"ARC\", \"0.44\", \"0.072\", \"-0.15\", \"0.008\", \"0.42\"]\n          - [\"few_shot_hijack\", \"MMLU\", \"0.32\", \"0.118\", \"-0.03\", \"0.605\", \"0.18\"]\n          - [\"few_shot_hijack\", \"ARC\", \"0.57\", \"0.002\", \"-0.07\", \"0.154\", \"0.38\"]\n          - [\"persona_manip\", \"MMLU\", \"0.38\", \"0.085\", \"-0.11\", \"0.062\", \"0.28\"]\n          - [\"persona_manip\", \"ARC\", \"0.35\", \"0.108\", \"-0.16\", \"0.038\", \"0.30\"]\n          - [\"instruction_override\", \"MMLU\", \"0.60\", \"<0.001\", \"-0.05\", \"0.321\", \"0.43\"]\n          - [\"instruction_override\", \"ARC\", \"0.53\", \"0.004\", \"0.09\", \"0.047\", \"0.37\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3: Forest plot of standardized β coefficients for η_max (blue) and K_eff (red) across 12 conditions. η_max consistently positive and large; K_eff scattered around zero with occasional weak negative values. Error bars (95% CI) for K_eff cross zero in 9/12 conditions.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Attack expansion 确认 weakest-link 在大多数攻击类型下成立，但揭示了 attack-type 异质性：\n      targeted attacks（prompt_injection, instruction_override）η_max 效应最强（β>0.50），\n      broad-spectrum attacks（sycophancy, persona_manipulation）效应减弱。Few-shot hijacking\n      在 MMLU 上出现 ceiling effect（所有模型 ASR>0.7），是方法论警告而非反例。\n      Persona manipulation 是论文中需要 explicitly address 的边界条件：当攻击不 adaptive-target\n      weakest judge 而是均匀影响所有 judge 时，diversity 确实有边际作用。这恰好支持\n      Claim 2（BFT distinction）——persona manipulation 更接近 \"random fault\" 模式，\n      K_eff 的边际显著正好验证了理论预测。论文策略：将 persona manipulation 作为\n      \"when does diversity help\" section 的核心案例。instruction_override 在 ARC 上\n      K_eff 异常正（p=0.04）需要报告但解释为 confound：高 K_eff panels 恰好包含更多\n      API 模型（instruction following 强），K_eff 和 capability 在该 subset 中混淆。\n\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  # plan_003: Adaptive adversary theorem + random-fault simulation\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  - name: \"Adaptive adversary formal theorem + random-fault simulation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      (a) 形式化证明 adaptive adversary 下 panel_ASR = Θ(η_max)；\n      (b) 实现 random-fault simulation（每个 judge 独立以 p_j 失败）；\n      (c) 对比 adaptive vs random-fault 下 K_eff 的预测力，验证 BFT distinction。\n      在 6 original conditions 上运行（不依赖 plan_001）。\n    expected_results:\n      # Theorem\n      theorem_bound: \"panel_ASR ≤ η_max · (1 + ε·log(K))\"\n      bound_tightness: \"within factor 1.3 of empirical\"\n      # Random-fault simulation\n      rf_keff_sig_negative_count: 4\n      rf_keff_sig_rate: 0.67\n      rf_eta_max_sig_count: 2\n      rf_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.33\n      # BFT contrast\n      adaptive_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.83\n      randomfault_keff_sig_rate: 0.67\n      contrast_cohen_d: 0.62\n      contrast_direction: \"correct\"\n      # Per-condition paired comparison\n      keff_beta_shift_mean: -0.35\n      keff_beta_shift_range_lo: -0.18\n      keff_beta_shift_range_hi: -0.52\n    result_rationale: >\n      Formal theorem: adaptive adversary 选择 argmax_j ASR_j，因此 panel 在 majority vote\n      下的 ASR 受限于攻击者能否翻转 ≥ceil(K/2) 个 judge。Adaptive adversary 最优策略是\n      先攻破最弱 judge，再依次攻击次弱 judge。因此 panel_ASR 主要项为 η_max，次要项为\n      ordered statistics 的衰减——当 K 增大时次弱 judge 的鲁棒性提供对数级修正，\n      给出 η_max·(1+ε·log(K)) 上界。在 median 档，empirical ASR 不完美吻合理论上界\n      （within factor 1.3 而非 optimistic 档的 1.1），因为实际攻击不完全 adaptive——\n      有些攻击（sycophancy）对所有 judge 都有一定效果，不完全集中在最弱 judge。\n\n      Random-fault simulation: 将每个 judge 的 failure 建模为独立 Bernoulli(p_j)，\n      p_j 取自 empirical ASR。在此设定下 K_eff 显著负（4/6 条件），因为独立失败下\n      增加独立 judge 确实降低 panel 失败概率（BFT 有效）。η_max 仅在 2/6 条件中显著，\n      因为 random fault 下攻击不集中在最弱 judge——每个 judge 的贡献更均匀。\n\n      Cohen's d = 0.62（中等效应量）而非 optimistic 的 >0.8，原因：在 sycophancy 和\n      persona-like 条件下，实际攻击本身就有 random-fault 成分（bias 影响所有 judge），\n      导致 adaptive vs random-fault 区分度降低。但 d=0.62 仍足以支持 \"distinct regimes\" 论点。\n      Reviewer 可能要求 confidence interval——95% CI 为 [0.28, 0.96]，下界 >0 但偏宽，\n      论文需要 acknowledge 这一点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Adaptive vs Random-Fault Regime Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"β(K_eff) Adaptive\", \"p Adaptive\", \"β(K_eff) Random-Fault\", \"p Random-Fault\", \"Δβ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU×prompt_inj\", \"-0.12\", \"0.031\", \"-0.48\", \"0.002\", \"-0.36\"]\n          - [\"MMLU×score_manip\", \"-0.06\", \"0.218\", \"-0.41\", \"0.008\", \"-0.35\"]\n          - [\"MMLU×sycophancy\", \"-0.04\", \"0.412\", \"-0.22\", \"0.078\", \"-0.18\"]\n          - [\"ARC×prompt_inj\", \"-0.08\", \"0.089\", \"-0.52\", \"<0.001\", \"-0.44\"]\n          - [\"ARC×score_manip\", \"-0.05\", \"0.287\", \"-0.38\", \"0.015\", \"-0.33\"]\n          - [\"ARC×sycophancy\", \"-0.15\", \"0.008\", \"-0.47\", \"0.003\", \"-0.32\"]\n      - name: \"Table 6: BFT Contrast Summary Statistics\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Adaptive\", \"Random-Fault\", \"Cohen's d\", \"95% CI\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"K_eff sig rate\", \"0.17\", \"0.67\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Mean |β(K_eff)|\", \"0.08\", \"0.41\", \"0.62\", \"[0.28, 0.96]\"]\n          - [\"Mean R²\", \"0.38\", \"0.44\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"η_max sig rate\", \"0.83\", \"0.33\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4a: Paired bar chart showing β(K_eff) under adaptive (light) vs random-fault (dark) regime for each of 6 conditions. Random-fault bars consistently more negative. Significance markers (* for p<0.05) appear on 4/6 random-fault bars but only 1/6 adaptive bars.\"\n      - \"Fig 4b: Schematic illustrating adaptive adversary targeting strategy (attack concentrates on weakest judge) vs random-fault (attacks distributed uniformly). Arrows show information flow from adversary to judges.\"\n    analysis: >\n      BFT distinction 是论文的理论核心，median 档下 Cohen's d=0.62 提供了 \"moderate\" 级别证据——\n      足以论证两种 regime 在统计上可区分，但不足以宣称 dramatic difference。论文策略：\n      (1) 报告 d=0.62 和宽 CI，honest 地说这是 moderate effect；(2) 用 sycophancy 条件\n      作为 \"bridge case\"——该攻击同时具有 adaptive 和 random 成分，恰好在两种 regime 间\n      过渡；(3) 理论贡献不依赖 effect size——theorem 本身是 worst-case bound，即使实际\n      攻击不完全 adaptive，bound 仍有效。Reviewer 若 push back on effect size，可回应\n      \"our theorem provides a security guarantee; the moderate empirical effect size reflects\n      that real attacks lie on a spectrum between fully adaptive and fully random, which\n      our framework captures.\"\n\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  # plan_004: Capability-matched validation\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  - name: \"Capability-matched validation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      在相同 capability tier 内（控制 η_max 方差）测试 K_eff 是否显著。\n      Tier 划分：Strong（70B + API，~8 models, C(8,3)=56 panels）、\n      Weak（7B + 14B, ~5 models, C(5,3)=10 panels）、\n      API-only（5 models, C(5,3)=10 panels）。6 conditions。\n    expected_results:\n      # Strong tier (70B + API)\n      strong_tier_n_panels: 56\n      strong_eta_max_sig_count: 3\n      strong_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.50\n      strong_keff_sig_negative_count: 1\n      strong_keff_sig_rate: 0.17\n      strong_median_R2: 0.22\n      strong_keff_median_beta: -0.15\n      # Weak tier (7B + 14B)\n      weak_tier_n_panels: 10\n      weak_eta_max_sig_count: 3\n      weak_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.50\n      weak_keff_sig_negative_count: 0\n      weak_keff_sig_rate: 0.00\n      weak_median_R2: 0.28\n      # API-only tier\n      api_tier_n_panels: 10\n      api_eta_max_sig_count: 2\n      api_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.33\n      api_keff_sig_negative_count: 1\n      api_keff_sig_rate: 0.17\n      api_median_R2: 0.18\n      api_keff_beta_when_sig: -0.22\n      # Within-tier diversity-capability tradeoff\n      within_tier_r_strong: -0.35\n      within_tier_r_weak: -0.28\n      within_tier_r_api: -0.32\n    result_rationale: >\n      Capability-matched analysis 是 median 档的关键 nuance 实验。控制 capability tier 后，\n      η_max 的方差被大幅压缩：Strong tier 内 η_max range 从全局的 [0.05, 0.85] 缩小到\n      [0.05, 0.35]，Weak tier 缩小到 [0.45, 0.85]。方差压缩导致 η_max 回归系数虽方向\n      正确但显著性下降（strong tier 3/6, weak tier 3/6, API 2/6）。\n\n      关键发现在 Strong tier 和 API tier：当所有模型个体鲁棒性都已较高（η_max < 0.35），\n      η_max 的 remaining variance 中，K_eff 的 marginal 贡献变得可检测。Strong tier 中\n      MMLU×prompt_injection 条件下 K_eff β=-0.15, p=0.04——当 panel 中全是 robust model 时，\n      diversity 提供了额外的边际防护。API tier 中类似（1/6 显著），但 N=10 power 太低\n      需要 caveat。\n\n      Weak tier 中 K_eff 0/6 显著——当模型都 weak 时，增加 diversity 只是换一个同样 weak\n      的 judge，没有安全增益。这是核心 insight：diversity helps only when the \"weakest link\"\n      is already strong。类比物理安全：给一栋所有门都坚固的建筑增加不同品牌的锁有边际帮助；\n      给一栋有敞开窗户的建筑加锁毫无意义。\n\n      Within-tier tradeoff r ≈ -0.32（strong）vs 全局 r=-0.65：tier 内 tradeoff 依然存在\n      但大幅减弱，因为 capability range 被控制。这表明全局 tradeoff 的主要驱动力是跨 tier\n      差异，而非 tier 内差异。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Within-Tier Regression Results (η_max Controlled)\"\n        columns: [\"Tier\", \"N panels\", \"η_max sig rate\", \"K_eff sig(-) rate\", \"Median R²\", \"r(K_eff,η_max)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Strong (70B+API)\", \"56\", \"3/6 (0.50)\", \"1/6 (0.17)\", \"0.22\", \"-0.35\"]\n          - [\"Weak (7B+14B)\", \"10\", \"3/6 (0.50)\", \"0/6 (0.00)\", \"0.28\", \"-0.28\"]\n          - [\"API-only\", \"10\", \"2/6 (0.33)\", \"1/6 (0.17)\", \"0.18\", \"-0.32\"]\n          - [\"Full pool (ref)\", \"455\", \"5/6 (0.83)\", \"1/6 (0.17)\", \"0.38\", \"-0.65\"]\n      - name: \"Table 8: API-Only Tier Detail (C(5,3)=10 Panels)\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"β(η_max)\", \"p(η_max)\", \"β(K_eff)\", \"p(K_eff)\", \"R²\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU×prompt_inj\", \"0.35\", \"0.042\", \"-0.22\", \"0.048\", \"0.21\"]\n          - [\"MMLU×score_manip\", \"0.28\", \"0.112\", \"-0.14\", \"0.187\", \"0.14\"]\n          - [\"MMLU×sycophancy\", \"0.22\", \"0.185\", \"-0.08\", \"0.412\", \"0.10\"]\n          - [\"ARC×prompt_inj\", \"0.38\", \"0.035\", \"-0.18\", \"0.082\", \"0.22\"]\n          - [\"ARC×score_manip\", \"0.25\", \"0.148\", \"-0.10\", \"0.285\", \"0.12\"]\n          - [\"ARC×sycophancy\", \"0.20\", \"0.218\", \"-0.20\", \"0.065\", \"0.18\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5: Three-panel scatter (Strong/Weak/API tier) of η_max vs panel ASR for one representative condition (MMLU×prompt_injection). Strong tier shows tight cluster with weak slope; Weak tier shows steep positive slope (weakest link drives ASR); API tier shows flat relationship. Regression lines with 95% CI bands.\"\n      - \"Fig 6: Bar chart comparing K_eff significance rate across tiers. Clear step pattern: Weak (0%) < Full (17%) < Strong (17%) ≈ API (17%), but with annotation showing Strong/API K_eff effect sizes are larger when significant.\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 median 档叙事的核心 ablation，直接回应 reviewer concern \"when does diversity help?\"。\n      答案清晰：diversity 仅在 capability-homogeneous high-robustness regime 中有边际作用。\n      但需诚实报告 limitations：(1) API tier N=10，统计功效低，显著结果需谨慎解读；\n      (2) Strong tier 1/6 显著可能是 multiple comparison 产物（6 tests, Bonferroni 后不再显著）。\n      论文建议策略：报告未校正和 Bonferroni 校正后的 p 值，并强调 effect size 而非 p 值——\n      即使 Bonferroni 后 K_eff 不显著，β=-0.15 的 direction 和 magnitude 仍是有信息量的。\n      Within-tier tradeoff r ≈ -0.32 表明即使在同一 tier 内，选择更 diverse 的 panel 仍会\n      略微牺牲 robustness，但代价远小于跨 tier 选择。这为 Claim 3 提供了 nuanced version：\n      \"the diversity-capability tradeoff is primarily driven by cross-tier selection;\n      within-tier, the tradeoff is attenuated but not eliminated.\"\n\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  # plan_005: Two-stage algorithm benchmark\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  - name: \"Two-stage panel design algorithm: full benchmark\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      实现 robustness-first 两阶段算法并与 5 baselines 对比。\n      策略：(1) Random, (2) Max-K_eff, (3) Min-η_max, (4) Max-family-diversity,\n      (5) Strongest-K, (6) Two-stage (filter η≤threshold, then max K_eff)。\n      在 15 模型池 × 6 conditions 上评估。Sweep threshold parameter。\n    expected_results:\n      two_stage_win_rate: 0.67\n      two_stage_win_count: 4\n      total_conditions: 6\n      min_eta_max_win_count: 1\n      strongest_k_win_count: 1\n      max_keff_rank: 4.2\n      max_family_div_rank: 4.8\n      random_rank: 5.1\n      # Two-stage vs alternatives in all-strong regime\n      strong_regime_two_stage_vs_max_keff_p: 0.32\n      strong_regime_two_stage_vs_min_eta_p: 0.28\n      strong_regime_difference: \"not significant\"\n      # Threshold sweep\n      optimal_threshold_range: [0.20, 0.35]\n      threshold_sensitivity: \"moderate\"\n      pareto_knee_eta: 0.28\n    result_rationale: >\n      Two-stage 算法在 4/6 conditions (0.67) 下 win（定义：最低 panel ASR），因为它在\n      第一阶段过滤掉 weak judge 后，第二阶段的 diversity maximization 在 robust-judge\n      pool 中确实提供边际增益（与 plan_004 结论一致）。但 median 档下 win rate 仅 0.67\n      而非 optimistic 的 >0.85：\n\n      (1) 在 MMLU×sycophancy 中 Min-η_max 策略赢——因为 sycophancy 攻击几乎完全由\n      个体鲁棒性决定，第二阶段的 diversity 增益为零，而 Min-η_max 省去了第二阶段的\n      diversity 妥协（有时 max K_eff 会选入一个略弱但更 diverse 的 judge）。\n\n      (2) 在 ARC×prompt_injection 中 Strongest-K 策略赢——该条件下最强 3 个模型恰好\n      也是最 robust against prompt injection 的（GPT-4o, Claude, GPT-4.1），而 two-stage\n      在 threshold=0.28 时让入了一个 borderline 模型。\n\n      All-strong regime（仅限 API 模型 pool）中，two-stage 与 max-K_eff 和 min-η_max\n      均无显著差异（p>0.25），因为所有候选模型都通过了 threshold——第一阶段 filter 变成\n      no-op，退化为 max-K_eff。这直接降低了 Claim 6 的价值：当模型都足够 robust 时，\n      任何合理策略都差不多。论文应将 Claim 6 从 \"formal algorithm\" 降级为 \"practical\n      guideline\"：先确保个体鲁棒性，然后在此基础上增加 diversity 是 good practice 但\n      不需要复杂算法。\n\n      Threshold sweep 显示最优 threshold 在 0.20-0.35 范围内，sensitivity 中等——\n      偏离最优 threshold ±0.10 导致 ASR 增加 ~15%（不是 dramatic failure，但也不 robust）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 9: Panel Selection Strategy Comparison (Mean ASR, Lower = Better)\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"MMLU×PI\", \"MMLU×SM\", \"MMLU×Syc\", \"ARC×PI\", \"ARC×SM\", \"ARC×Syc\", \"Mean Rank\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Two-stage (ours)\", \"0.082\", \"0.095\", \"0.118\", \"0.068\", \"0.075\", \"0.088\", \"1.7\"]\n          - [\"Min-η_max\", \"0.091\", \"0.098\", \"0.105\", \"0.072\", \"0.079\", \"0.092\", \"2.2\"]\n          - [\"Strongest-K\", \"0.088\", \"0.102\", \"0.125\", \"0.062\", \"0.082\", \"0.098\", \"2.8\"]\n          - [\"Max-K_eff\", \"0.145\", \"0.152\", \"0.168\", \"0.118\", \"0.128\", \"0.142\", \"4.2\"]\n          - [\"Max-family-div\", \"0.162\", \"0.175\", \"0.188\", \"0.135\", \"0.148\", \"0.158\", \"4.8\"]\n          - [\"Random\", \"0.178\", \"0.185\", \"0.195\", \"0.148\", \"0.155\", \"0.172\", \"5.1\"]\n      - name: \"Table 10: Threshold Sensitivity Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Threshold (η)\", \"N judges passing\", \"Mean ASR\", \"Δ from optimal\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0.10\", \"3\", \"0.092\", \"+0.008\"]\n          - [\"0.20\", \"6\", \"0.085\", \"+0.001\"]\n          - [\"0.25\", \"8\", \"0.084\", \"0.000\"]\n          - [\"0.30\", \"10\", \"0.088\", \"+0.004\"]\n          - [\"0.40\", \"12\", \"0.105\", \"+0.021\"]\n          - [\"0.50\", \"14\", \"0.132\", \"+0.048\"]\n          - [\"1.00 (no filter)\", \"15\", \"0.145\", \"+0.061\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 7: Pareto frontier plot with x-axis = mean panel η_max, y-axis = mean panel K_eff. Each strategy is a point. Two-stage traces a curve as threshold varies. Knee at threshold≈0.28. Min-η_max is at top-left (low η_max, low K_eff); Max-K_eff at bottom-right (high η_max, high K_eff).\"\n    analysis: >\n      Two-stage 算法在 median 档下优势温和但一致（mean rank 1.7 vs 次优 min-η_max 的 2.2）。\n      关键 insight：策略差异主要来自 Max-K_eff 和 Max-family-div 的 bad performance\n      （rank 4-5），而非 Two-stage 的 exceptional performance。Top-3 策略（Two-stage,\n      Min-η_max, Strongest-K）之间差异较小，在 all-strong regime 中更是不显著。\n      这意味着论文的 practical message 是：\"avoid diversity-first strategies\" 而不是\n      \"use our specific algorithm\"。Claim 6 相应降级为 practical guideline：\n      \"When designing multi-judge panels, prioritize individual robustness over diversity.\n      Among robustness-qualified judges, diversity is a useful tiebreaker.\"\n      Threshold sensitivity 中 moderate 意味着不需要精确调参——threshold 在 0.20-0.35\n      范围内都 reasonable，不像某些 ML hyperparameters 那样 brittle。\n\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  # plan_006: Per-judge ASR concentration\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  - name: \"Per-judge ASR concentration analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      对每个 panel × attack，测量 per-judge ASR 分布的集中度（Gini, Entropy,\n      最弱 judge 占比）。验证 adaptive adversary 是否确实将攻击集中在最弱 judge 上。\n      455 panels × 6 conditions。\n    expected_results:\n      gini_median: 0.42\n      gini_range_lo: 0.15\n      gini_range_hi: 0.68\n      gini_strong_tier_median: 0.28\n      gini_weak_tier_median: 0.52\n      weakest_judge_asr_share_median: 0.58\n      weakest_judge_share_strong_tier: 0.42\n      weakest_judge_share_weak_tier: 0.68\n      entropy_ratio_to_uniform_median: 0.72\n      concentration_eta_max_correlation: 0.55\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 Gini=0.42 表明攻击成功有中等程度的集中性——不是完全集中在最弱 judge\n      （Gini>0.7 = optimistic），也不是均匀分布（Gini<0.2）。最弱 judge 承担 58% 的\n      攻击成功（在 K=3 panel 中均匀分布期望值为 33%），是其他 judge 的约 1.7 倍——\n      方向正确但非压倒性。\n\n      Tier 差异揭示机制：Weak tier Gini=0.52, weakest share=68%——weak models 中\n      最弱那个被 disproportionately 攻击（adaptive targeting 效果明显）。Strong tier\n      Gini=0.28, weakest share=42%——strong models 间差异小，攻击更分散。这与 plan_004\n      发现一致：Strong tier 中 diversity 有边际作用恰好因为攻击不完全集中在最弱 judge。\n\n      concentration 与 η_max 相关性 r=0.55（中等）而非 >0.8（optimistic），因为\n      sycophancy 和 persona manipulation 攻击对 strong judge 也有一定效果，拉低了\n      整体集中度。这为理论 bound 的 \"within factor 1.3\" 提供了解释：实际攻击在\n      fully-adaptive（bound 假设）和 partially-random（现实）之间。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11: Per-Judge ASR Concentration Metrics\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Overall\", \"Strong Tier\", \"Weak Tier\", \"API Tier\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Gini coefficient (median)\", \"0.42\", \"0.28\", \"0.52\", \"0.25\"]\n          - [\"Weakest judge ASR share\", \"0.58\", \"0.42\", \"0.68\", \"0.40\"]\n          - [\"Entropy ratio (vs uniform)\", \"0.72\", \"0.82\", \"0.62\", \"0.85\"]\n          - [\"Corr(concentration, η_max)\", \"0.55\", \"0.38\", \"0.48\", \"0.32\"]\n      - name: \"Table 12: Concentration by Attack Type\"\n        columns: [\"Attack\", \"Gini (median)\", \"Weakest Share\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"prompt_injection\", \"0.52\", \"0.65\", \"Highly targeted\"]\n          - [\"score_manipulation\", \"0.48\", \"0.62\", \"Targeted\"]\n          - [\"instruction_override\", \"0.55\", \"0.68\", \"Highly targeted\"]\n          - [\"few_shot_hijack\", \"0.45\", \"0.58\", \"Moderately targeted\"]\n          - [\"sycophancy\", \"0.32\", \"0.48\", \"Partially distributed\"]\n          - [\"persona_manip\", \"0.28\", \"0.42\", \"Distributed\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 8a: Violin plot of per-judge ASR Gini coefficient stratified by tier (Strong/Weak/API). Weak tier distribution shifted right (higher concentration). Horizontal line at Gini=0.33 (perfect concentration on one of three judges).\"\n      - \"Fig 8b: Stacked bar chart showing ASR attribution to weakest/middle/strongest judge, averaged across panels, for each attack type. Prompt injection and instruction override show tall 'weakest' bars; sycophancy and persona manipulation show more balanced distribution.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Concentration analysis 提供了 adaptive adversary 假设的直接 empirical 检验——\n      但 median 档下证据是 moderate 而非 conclusive。Gini=0.42 和 weakest share=58%\n      支持 \"attacks concentrate on weakest judge\" 但不支持 \"attacks EXCLUSIVELY target\n      weakest judge\"。论文应诚实报告：real-world attacks lie on a spectrum between\n      fully adaptive and fully random。Attack type 是关键调节变量——prompt injection\n      几乎完全 adaptive（Gini=0.52），persona manipulation 接近 distributed（Gini=0.28）。\n      这为 Section 5 \"When Does Diversity Help?\" 提供数据：diversity 在 distributed attacks\n      中更有用。Tier 差异（Strong Gini=0.28 vs Weak Gini=0.52）为 plan_004 的 within-tier\n      发现提供了 mechanistic explanation。\n\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  # plan_007: Diversity-capability tradeoff visualization\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  - name: \"Diversity-capability tradeoff visualization\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      对 C(15,3)=455 panels 绘制 K_eff vs η_max，拟合 tradeoff curve，\n      展示 Pareto frontier，按 capability tier 分层分析。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_r: -0.65\n      overall_r_p: \"<0.001\"\n      within_7B_r: -0.28\n      within_70B_r: -0.35\n      within_api_r: -0.32\n      cross_tier_r: -0.78\n      pareto_frontier_n_panels: 12\n      pareto_knee_keff: 2.1\n      pareto_knee_eta_max: 0.18\n    result_rationale: >\n      Overall r=-0.65 反映了一个结构性现象：当前 LLM 生态系统中，模型 diversity 主要来自\n      capability 差异（不同 size、不同训练数据量、不同 RLHF 程度），而 capability 差异\n      直接导致 robustness 差异。7B 模型 diverse from 70B 模型（高 K_eff），但也 weaker\n      （高 η_max）。\n\n      Cross-tier r=-0.78（强负相关）vs within-tier r≈-0.32（弱负相关）清晰分解了 tradeoff\n      来源：~70% 的 tradeoff 来自跨 tier 选择（选入 weak model 来增加 diversity），\n      ~30% 来自 tier 内差异（即使同 tier 模型，更 diverse 的组合也略微牺牲 robustness）。\n\n      Median 档下 overall r=-0.65 而非 optimistic 的 r<-0.8，因为 API 模型引入了\n      \"high diversity + high robustness\" 区域：GPT-4o 和 Claude 来自不同 family、\n      不同训练 paradigm（高 K_eff），但个体鲁棒性都高（低 η_max）。这些 data points\n      拉弱了全局负相关。这是论文的重要 nuance：tradeoff 在当前生态系统中存在，但\n      随着 API 模型整体能力提升，tradeoff 正在减弱。\n\n      Pareto frontier 上 12 个 panels（从 455 中）揭示了最优选择区域：knee 在\n      K_eff≈2.1, η_max≈0.18，对应 \"2-3 strong API models + 1 strong open-source model\"\n      的组合。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: Diversity-Capability Tradeoff by Tier\"\n        columns: [\"Analysis Scope\", \"N panels\", \"r(K_eff, η_max)\", \"p-value\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Overall\", \"455\", \"-0.65\", \"<0.001\", \"Strong tradeoff\"]\n          - [\"Within 7B tier\", \"10\", \"-0.28\", \"0.082\", \"Weak/non-significant\"]\n          - [\"Within 70B tier\", \"10\", \"-0.35\", \"0.045\", \"Moderate\"]\n          - [\"Within API tier\", \"10\", \"-0.32\", \"0.058\", \"Moderate/non-significant\"]\n          - [\"Cross-tier only\", \"425\", \"-0.78\", \"<0.001\", \"Dominant driver\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 9a: Scatter plot of K_eff (x) vs η_max (y) for 455 panels, color-coded by tier composition (all-strong=blue, mixed=gray, all-weak=red). Negative slope visible. Pareto frontier marked in black. API-heavy panels cluster in desirable low-η_max, moderate-K_eff region.\"\n      - \"Fig 9b: Same data with contour overlay showing panel ASR (lighter = lower ASR). Optimal region hugs the Pareto frontier at the knee, not at max-K_eff (right edge, high ASR) or min-η_max (left edge, low K_eff).\"\n    analysis: >\n      Tradeoff visualization 是论文最直观的 figure。r=-0.65 足够强来支持 Claim 3，\n      但 within-tier 分析（r≈-0.32）要求 nuanced framing：\"the tradeoff is primarily\n      structural (driven by cross-tier selection) rather than fundamental.\"\n      这意味着如果未来 LLM 生态系统能力 baseline 整体提升（所有模型都变强），tradeoff\n      可能自然消失——这是 limitations 中应讨论的点。Pareto frontier 分析直接支持\n      Claim 6 的降级版本：最优策略不需要复杂算法，只需 \"pick from the Pareto frontier\"，\n      而 frontier 上的 panels 特征明确——强模型为主 + 适度多样性。\n\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  # plan_008: Panel size sensitivity\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  - name: \"Panel size sensitivity: K=3,5,7,9\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      测试 weakest-link theorem 在不同 panel size 下的稳健性。\n      K=3 (C(15,3)=455), K=5 (C(15,5)=3003), K=7 (C(15,7)=6435),\n      K=9 (C(15,9)=5005)。6 conditions per K。\n    expected_results:\n      # K=3\n      k3_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n      k3_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.67\n      k3_eta_keff_beta_ratio: 5.2\n      k3_median_R2: 0.38\n      # K=5\n      k5_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n      k5_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.50\n      k5_keff_sig_negative_count: 2\n      k5_eta_keff_beta_ratio: 3.8\n      k5_median_R2: 0.35\n      # K=7\n      k7_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n      k7_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.50\n      k7_keff_sig_negative_count: 3\n      k7_eta_keff_beta_ratio: 2.6\n      k7_median_R2: 0.32\n      # K=9\n      k9_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n      k9_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.33\n      k9_keff_sig_negative_count: 3\n      k9_eta_keff_beta_ratio: 2.1\n      k9_median_R2: 0.30\n      # Trend\n      keff_importance_trend: \"monotonically increasing with K\"\n      eta_max_dominance_persists: true\n      crossover_k: \"not reached at K=9; extrapolation suggests K≈15-20\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Panel size 增大时 K_eff 重要性单调递增，原因是 majority vote 机制：K=3 时攻击者只需\n      翻转 2/3 judge（容易集中攻击），K=9 时需翻转 5/9（被迫分散攻击资源）。随着 K 增大，\n      攻击从 fully-adaptive（集中在最弱 judge）被迫转向 partially-distributed，K_eff\n      的 BFT 式保护效应逐渐显现。\n\n      Median 档下 β ratio 从 K=3 的 5.2:1 下降到 K=9 的 2.1:1——η_max 始终 dominant\n      但优势逐渐缩小。K_eff 在 K=7 和 K=9 时分别有 3/6 条件显著负。但 crossover point\n      （K_eff 重要性超过 η_max）未在 K≤9 范围内达到——外推估计需要 K≈15-20，这在实际\n      部署中不现实（成本、延迟）。\n\n      η_max 显著率在所有 K 下保持 ~0.83：无论 panel 多大，最弱 judge 的个体鲁棒性\n      始终是 ASR 的强预测因子。这是论文的稳健性 finding——weakest-link 在实际 panel size\n      范围内（K=3-9）始终成立。\n\n      R² 随 K 增大略微下降（0.38→0.30），因为大 panel 的 ASR 方差被 voting mechanism\n      本身压缩——多数投票自带平滑效果，降低了任何单一因子的可解释方差。\n\n      对论文 practical implication：增加 panel size 有 diminishing returns——从 K=3 到\n      K=5 ASR 降低 ~25%，从 K=5 到 K=7 仅降 ~12%，从 K=7 到 K=9 仅降 ~6%。\n      Robustness-first message 在所有 K 下成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 14: Weakest-Link Stability Across Panel Sizes\"\n        columns: [\"Panel Size K\", \"N panels\", \"η_max sig rate\", \"K_eff sig(-) rate\", \"β ratio (η/K)\", \"Median R²\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"K=3\", \"455\", \"5/6 (0.83)\", \"1/6 (0.17)\", \"5.2\", \"0.38\"]\n          - [\"K=5\", \"3003\", \"5/6 (0.83)\", \"2/6 (0.33)\", \"3.8\", \"0.35\"]\n          - [\"K=7\", \"6435\", \"5/6 (0.83)\", \"3/6 (0.50)\", \"2.6\", \"0.32\"]\n          - [\"K=9\", \"5005\", \"5/6 (0.83)\", \"3/6 (0.50)\", \"2.1\", \"0.30\"]\n      - name: \"Table 15: Mean Panel ASR by Size and Strategy\"\n        columns: [\"K\", \"Two-stage\", \"Min-η_max\", \"Max-K_eff\", \"Random\", \"Δ(Two-stage vs Random)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"3\", \"0.084\", \"0.093\", \"0.145\", \"0.178\", \"-53%\"]\n          - [\"5\", \"0.062\", \"0.068\", \"0.098\", \"0.135\", \"-54%\"]\n          - [\"7\", \"0.048\", \"0.052\", \"0.072\", \"0.108\", \"-56%\"]\n          - [\"9\", \"0.041\", \"0.044\", \"0.058\", \"0.092\", \"-55%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 10a: Line plot with K on x-axis, standardized β on y-axis, two lines for η_max (blue, decreasing slowly) and K_eff (red, increasing from near-zero). Lines converge but don't cross by K=9. Shaded region shows 95% CI. Extrapolated crossover at K≈15-20 (dashed).\"\n      - \"Fig 10b: Bar chart of mean ASR by strategy and K. All strategies improve with K but converge — the gap between Two-stage and Random shrinks proportionally (~55% reduction maintained). Diminishing returns visible.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Panel size analysis 提供了 weakest-link theorem 的 boundary condition：η_max 在 K≤9\n      范围内始终 dominant，但 K_eff 重要性随 K 增大而增加。Median 档下 crossover 不在\n      实际范围内（K≈15-20），保护了论文核心 claim。但 reviewer 可能问 \"what about K=15?\"——\n      论文应回应：(1) K=15 在实际部署中不 economical；(2) 即使 K=15，η_max 仍然 significant，\n      只是不再 dominant；(3) 更重要的是 diminishing returns——从 K=9 到 K=15 的安全增益\n      不值得 67% 的成本增加。\n\n      这个实验也为 Claim 2（BFT distinction）提供了新角度：K 增大 effectively 使攻击\n      \"more random-like\"（攻击者被迫分散资源），所以 K_eff 的保护效应增强——这正是\n      BFT 理论预测的。论文可以将此表述为 \"panel size modulates the effective adaptivity\n      of the adversary\"。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4126,"cache_read_input_tokens":29352,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4126},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"790d1674-f3e2-44e8-8259-048eca3893b4","uuid":"96bdb4b1-8528-4e45-859b-ebdd006f27fd"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":390227,"duration_api_ms":391530,"num_turns":5,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  从 \"diversity never helps\" 软化为 \"individual robustness is the dominant factor;\n  diversity provides marginal benefit only when individual robustness is already high\"。\n  Title 用 \"The Weakest Link\" 而非 \"The Diversity Trap\"。Claim 2 区分 capability-homogeneous\n  vs heterogeneous regime，承认前者中 diversity 有边际作用。Claim 6 从 formal algorithm\n  降级为 guideline。补充 \"when does diversity help\" 的 ablation (plan_004) 堵 reviewer concern。\n  核心 negative result + adaptive adversary bound + regime analysis 仍构成 EMNLP contribution stack，\n  但叙事需更 nuanced，不能 overclaim。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  # plan_001: Scale expansion\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  - name: \"Scale expansion: 15+ models (API + large open-source)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      将模型池从 6 扩展到 15（新增 GPT-4o-mini, GPT-4o, GPT-4.1, Claude-3.5-Sonnet,\n      Gemini-1.5-Pro, Llama-3.1-70B, Qwen2.5-72B, Mixtral-8x22B）。在 C(15,3)=455 panels\n      上重跑 MI matrix 和 multivariate regression。2 datasets × 3 attacks = 6 conditions。\n    expected_results:\n      total_panels: 455\n      total_mi_pairs: 105\n      # Regression results\n      eta_max_sig_count: 5\n      eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n      eta_max_median_beta: 0.52\n      keff_sig_negative_count: 1\n      keff_sig_positive_count: 1\n      keff_nonsig_count: 4\n      keff_nonsig_rate: 0.67\n      keff_median_beta_when_sig: -0.12\n      median_R2: 0.38\n      R2_eta_only: 0.34\n      R2_increment_from_keff: 0.04\n      # MI matrix\n      copula_underestimate_median: 42\n      copula_underestimate_range_lo: 8\n      copula_underestimate_range_hi: 210\n      family_label_mann_whitney_p: 0.12\n      # Diversity-capability tradeoff (preview)\n      keff_eta_max_r_overall: -0.65\n    result_rationale: >\n      N=455 panels 比 MVP 的 N=20 提供了极大的统计功效提升。η_max 在 MVP 中已 4/6 显著，\n      扩大样本量后即使效果量不变也更容易达到显著性，因此升至 5/6。但 median 档非 100%：\n      ARC×sycophancy 条件下 η_max 方差在 API 模型中被压缩（API 模型 η_max 整体偏低且聚集），\n      导致该条件下 η_max 效应被稀释（p ≈ 0.07）。K_eff 在 MVP 中 1/6 显著负（arc×sycophancy），\n      扩展后高功效检测到弱效应：MMLU×prompt_injection 中 K_eff 呈弱显著负（β=-0.12, p=0.03），\n      但标准化效应量仅为 η_max 的 1/4。同时 MMLU×position 中 K_eff 出现与 MVP 一致的异常\n      正效应（p=0.04），原因是 position bias 在高多样性 panel 中反而触发更多 judge 的\n      共享 bias。API 模型引入新现象：GPT-4o/Claude/Gemini 三者个体鲁棒性都高（η_max 低），\n      它们组成的 panel 中 η_max 方差被压缩，K_eff 的边际效应变得可检测。Copula 中位数从\n      MVP 的 10-21× 变为 42×，因为 API 模型间的高阶依赖（共享训练数据 distribution）\n      比开源模型间更强，但 Gaussian copula 仍然无法捕捉。Family label 测试 p=0.12：新增\n      5 个 API 模型（理论上 5 个不同 family）推高了 cross-family 样本量，但 API 模型间\n      MI 反而偏高（共享训练 paradigm），导致 within vs cross-family 区分依然不显著。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: Multivariate Regression on 455 Panels (15 Models)\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"β(η_max)\", \"p(η_max)\", \"β(K_eff)\", \"p(K_eff)\", \"R²\", \"ΔR²(+K_eff)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU×prompt_inj\", \"0.58\", \"0.001\", \"-0.12\", \"0.031\", \"0.41\", \"+0.04\"]\n          - [\"MMLU×score_manip\", \"0.51\", \"0.003\", \"-0.06\", \"0.218\", \"0.36\", \"+0.01\"]\n          - [\"MMLU×sycophancy\", \"0.47\", \"<0.001\", \"-0.04\", \"0.412\", \"0.35\", \"+0.00\"]\n          - [\"ARC×prompt_inj\", \"0.55\", \"<0.001\", \"-0.08\", \"0.089\", \"0.39\", \"+0.02\"]\n          - [\"ARC×score_manip\", \"0.49\", \"0.005\", \"-0.05\", \"0.287\", \"0.34\", \"+0.01\"]\n          - [\"ARC×sycophancy\", \"0.44\", \"0.072\", \"-0.15\", \"0.008\", \"0.42\", \"+0.06\"]\n      - name: \"Table 3: Copula Underestimation Ratio (15-model MI Matrix)\"\n        columns: [\"Model Pair Type\", \"N pairs\", \"Median MI_obs/MI_gauss\", \"Range\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Open-source × Open-source\", \"15\", \"28×\", \"8-145×\"]\n          - [\"API × API\", \"10\", \"68×\", \"32-210×\"]\n          - [\"Open-source × API\", \"80\", \"41×\", \"12-180×\"]\n          - [\"Overall\", \"105\", \"42×\", \"8-210×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2a: Scatter plot of η_max vs K_eff for 455 panels, color-coded by capability tier (7B/14-32B/70B/API). Clear negative slope (r=-0.65) with API-only panels forming a distinct cluster in the low-η_max, moderate-K_eff region.\"\n      - \"Fig 2b: Heatmap of 15×15 pairwise MI matrix (MMLU), clustered by capability rather than family. API models cluster together despite different families. Diagonal blocks correspond to capability tiers, not model families.\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心发现：η_max 仍然是主导预测因子（5/6 条件显著），但 K_eff 不再是完全无关——\n      在 1/6 条件中呈弱显著负效应（diversity 有边际帮助）。关键 nuance：K_eff 显著的条件\n      恰好是 η_max 方差最大的条件（arc×sycophancy，R²=0.42），提示当个体鲁棒性差异大时\n      diversity 的边际价值才可检测。API 模型引入 \"全强 regime\"：在这个 regime 中 weakest-link\n      效应减弱（因为没有明显 weak link），diversity 的边际效应变得相对更重要。这要求论文\n      叙事从 \"diversity never helps\" 转为 \"diversity's marginal benefit is dominated by\n      and conditional on individual robustness\"。Copula 失败结论进一步加强（中位 42× vs\n      MVP 的 10-21×），特别是 API 模型间的 68× 中位数表明这些模型共享比开源模型更强的\n      隐性依赖。ΔR² 分析是关键防守数据：加入 K_eff 后 R² 平均仅提升 0.02，最高 0.06，\n      表明 diversity 的解释力在统计显著的条件下也很有限。\n\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  # plan_002: Attack expansion\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  - name: \"Attack expansion: 6+ attack types\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      在 plan_001 的 15 模型池基础上新增 few-shot hijacking, persona manipulation,\n      instruction override 三种攻击。总计 2 datasets × 6 attacks = 12 conditions，\n      455 panels/condition。验证 weakest-link 跨攻击面普适性。\n    expected_results:\n      total_conditions: 12\n      eta_max_sig_count: 8\n      eta_max_sig_rate: 0.67\n      keff_sig_negative_count: 2\n      keff_sig_positive_count: 1\n      keff_nonsig_count: 9\n      keff_nonsig_rate: 0.75\n      keff_median_beta_when_sig: -0.14\n      eta_max_median_beta: 0.48\n      median_R2: 0.36\n      new_attack_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.50\n      new_attack_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.83\n    result_rationale: >\n      新攻击类型中，few-shot hijacking 和 instruction override 是典型 targeted attack，\n      η_max 效应强（β≈0.55-0.60），K_eff 无关——攻击者直接针对最弱 judge 的 instruction\n      following 缺陷，diversity 无法对冲。Persona manipulation 是唯一例外：该攻击利用\n      judge 对 authority/persona 的响应差异，不同模型的 persona susceptibility 分布更均匀\n      （不像 prompt injection 那样集中在弱模型），导致 η_max 效应减弱（p≈0.08-0.12），\n      K_eff 在 ARC×persona 中呈弱显著负（p=0.04）。这解释了为什么 8/12 而非 12/12 η_max\n      显著：4 个不显著条件中 3 个涉及 persona manipulation（2 个 dataset）和 ARC×sycophancy\n      （延续 plan_001 趋势），1 个是 MMLU×authority（边缘 p=0.06）。新攻击整体 η_max\n      显著率（3/6=0.50）低于原有攻击（5/6=0.83），因为 few-shot hijacking 在 MMLU 上\n      所有模型 ASR 都很高（ceiling effect，η_max 方差被压缩），persona manipulation 如上述。\n      K_eff 在新攻击中仅 1/6 显著负——targeted attack 本质上不给 diversity 发挥空间。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4: Regression Summary Across 12 Conditions (455 Panels)\"\n        columns: [\"Attack Type\", \"Dataset\", \"β(η_max)\", \"p(η_max)\", \"β(K_eff)\", \"p(K_eff)\", \"R²\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"prompt_injection\", \"MMLU\", \"0.58\", \"0.001\", \"-0.12\", \"0.031\", \"0.41\"]\n          - [\"prompt_injection\", \"ARC\", \"0.55\", \"<0.001\", \"-0.08\", \"0.089\", \"0.39\"]\n          - [\"score_manipulation\", \"MMLU\", \"0.51\", \"0.003\", \"-0.06\", \"0.218\", \"0.36\"]\n          - [\"score_manipulation\", \"ARC\", \"0.49\", \"0.005\", \"-0.05\", \"0.287\", \"0.34\"]\n          - [\"sycophancy\", \"MMLU\", \"0.47\", \"<0.001\", \"-0.04\", \"0.412\", \"0.35\"]\n          - [\"sycophancy\", \"ARC\", \"0.44\", \"0.072\", \"-0.15\", \"0.008\", \"0.42\"]\n          - [\"few_shot_hijack\", \"MMLU\", \"0.32\", \"0.118\", \"-0.03\", \"0.605\", \"0.18\"]\n          - [\"few_shot_hijack\", \"ARC\", \"0.57\", \"0.002\", \"-0.07\", \"0.154\", \"0.38\"]\n          - [\"persona_manip\", \"MMLU\", \"0.38\", \"0.085\", \"-0.11\", \"0.062\", \"0.28\"]\n          - [\"persona_manip\", \"ARC\", \"0.35\", \"0.108\", \"-0.16\", \"0.038\", \"0.30\"]\n          - [\"instruction_override\", \"MMLU\", \"0.60\", \"<0.001\", \"-0.05\", \"0.321\", \"0.43\"]\n          - [\"instruction_override\", \"ARC\", \"0.53\", \"0.004\", \"0.09\", \"0.047\", \"0.37\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3: Forest plot of standardized β coefficients for η_max (blue) and K_eff (red) across 12 conditions. η_max consistently positive and large; K_eff scattered around zero with occasional weak negative values. Error bars (95% CI) for K_eff cross zero in 9/12 conditions.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Attack expansion 确认 weakest-link 在大多数攻击类型下成立，但揭示了 attack-type 异质性：\n      targeted attacks（prompt_injection, instruction_override）η_max 效应最强（β>0.50），\n      broad-spectrum attacks（sycophancy, persona_manipulation）效应减弱。Few-shot hijacking\n      在 MMLU 上出现 ceiling effect（所有模型 ASR>0.7），是方法论警告而非反例。\n      Persona manipulation 是论文中需要 explicitly address 的边界条件：当攻击不 adaptive-target\n      weakest judge 而是均匀影响所有 judge 时，diversity 确实有边际作用。这恰好支持\n      Claim 2（BFT distinction）——persona manipulation 更接近 \"random fault\" 模式，\n      K_eff 的边际显著正好验证了理论预测。论文策略：将 persona manipulation 作为\n      \"when does diversity help\" section 的核心案例。instruction_override 在 ARC 上\n      K_eff 异常正（p=0.04）需要报告但解释为 confound：高 K_eff panels 恰好包含更多\n      API 模型（instruction following 强），K_eff 和 capability 在该 subset 中混淆。\n\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  # plan_003: Adaptive adversary theorem + random-fault simulation\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  - name: \"Adaptive adversary formal theorem + random-fault simulation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      (a) 形式化证明 adaptive adversary 下 panel_ASR = Θ(η_max)；\n      (b) 实现 random-fault simulation（每个 judge 独立以 p_j 失败）；\n      (c) 对比 adaptive vs random-fault 下 K_eff 的预测力，验证 BFT distinction。\n      在 6 original conditions 上运行（不依赖 plan_001）。\n    expected_results:\n      # Theorem\n      theorem_bound: \"panel_ASR ≤ η_max · (1 + ε·log(K))\"\n      bound_tightness: \"within factor 1.3 of empirical\"\n      # Random-fault simulation\n      rf_keff_sig_negative_count: 4\n      rf_keff_sig_rate: 0.67\n      rf_eta_max_sig_count: 2\n      rf_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.33\n      # BFT contrast\n      adaptive_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.83\n      randomfault_keff_sig_rate: 0.67\n      contrast_cohen_d: 0.62\n      contrast_direction: \"correct\"\n      # Per-condition paired comparison\n      keff_beta_shift_mean: -0.35\n      keff_beta_shift_range_lo: -0.18\n      keff_beta_shift_range_hi: -0.52\n    result_rationale: >\n      Formal theorem: adaptive adversary 选择 argmax_j ASR_j，因此 panel 在 majority vote\n      下的 ASR 受限于攻击者能否翻转 ≥ceil(K/2) 个 judge。Adaptive adversary 最优策略是\n      先攻破最弱 judge，再依次攻击次弱 judge。因此 panel_ASR 主要项为 η_max，次要项为\n      ordered statistics 的衰减——当 K 增大时次弱 judge 的鲁棒性提供对数级修正，\n      给出 η_max·(1+ε·log(K)) 上界。在 median 档，empirical ASR 不完美吻合理论上界\n      （within factor 1.3 而非 optimistic 档的 1.1），因为实际攻击不完全 adaptive——\n      有些攻击（sycophancy）对所有 judge 都有一定效果，不完全集中在最弱 judge。\n\n      Random-fault simulation: 将每个 judge 的 failure 建模为独立 Bernoulli(p_j)，\n      p_j 取自 empirical ASR。在此设定下 K_eff 显著负（4/6 条件），因为独立失败下\n      增加独立 judge 确实降低 panel 失败概率（BFT 有效）。η_max 仅在 2/6 条件中显著，\n      因为 random fault 下攻击不集中在最弱 judge——每个 judge 的贡献更均匀。\n\n      Cohen's d = 0.62（中等效应量）而非 optimistic 的 >0.8，原因：在 sycophancy 和\n      persona-like 条件下，实际攻击本身就有 random-fault 成分（bias 影响所有 judge），\n      导致 adaptive vs random-fault 区分度降低。但 d=0.62 仍足以支持 \"distinct regimes\" 论点。\n      Reviewer 可能要求 confidence interval——95% CI 为 [0.28, 0.96]，下界 >0 但偏宽，\n      论文需要 acknowledge 这一点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Adaptive vs Random-Fault Regime Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"β(K_eff) Adaptive\", \"p Adaptive\", \"β(K_eff) Random-Fault\", \"p Random-Fault\", \"Δβ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU×prompt_inj\", \"-0.12\", \"0.031\", \"-0.48\", \"0.002\", \"-0.36\"]\n          - [\"MMLU×score_manip\", \"-0.06\", \"0.218\", \"-0.41\", \"0.008\", \"-0.35\"]\n          - [\"MMLU×sycophancy\", \"-0.04\", \"0.412\", \"-0.22\", \"0.078\", \"-0.18\"]\n          - [\"ARC×prompt_inj\", \"-0.08\", \"0.089\", \"-0.52\", \"<0.001\", \"-0.44\"]\n          - [\"ARC×score_manip\", \"-0.05\", \"0.287\", \"-0.38\", \"0.015\", \"-0.33\"]\n          - [\"ARC×sycophancy\", \"-0.15\", \"0.008\", \"-0.47\", \"0.003\", \"-0.32\"]\n      - name: \"Table 6: BFT Contrast Summary Statistics\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Adaptive\", \"Random-Fault\", \"Cohen's d\", \"95% CI\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"K_eff sig rate\", \"0.17\", \"0.67\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Mean |β(K_eff)|\", \"0.08\", \"0.41\", \"0.62\", \"[0.28, 0.96]\"]\n          - [\"Mean R²\", \"0.38\", \"0.44\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"η_max sig rate\", \"0.83\", \"0.33\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4a: Paired bar chart showing β(K_eff) under adaptive (light) vs random-fault (dark) regime for each of 6 conditions. Random-fault bars consistently more negative. Significance markers (* for p<0.05) appear on 4/6 random-fault bars but only 1/6 adaptive bars.\"\n      - \"Fig 4b: Schematic illustrating adaptive adversary targeting strategy (attack concentrates on weakest judge) vs random-fault (attacks distributed uniformly). Arrows show information flow from adversary to judges.\"\n    analysis: >\n      BFT distinction 是论文的理论核心，median 档下 Cohen's d=0.62 提供了 \"moderate\" 级别证据——\n      足以论证两种 regime 在统计上可区分，但不足以宣称 dramatic difference。论文策略：\n      (1) 报告 d=0.62 和宽 CI，honest 地说这是 moderate effect；(2) 用 sycophancy 条件\n      作为 \"bridge case\"——该攻击同时具有 adaptive 和 random 成分，恰好在两种 regime 间\n      过渡；(3) 理论贡献不依赖 effect size——theorem 本身是 worst-case bound，即使实际\n      攻击不完全 adaptive，bound 仍有效。Reviewer 若 push back on effect size，可回应\n      \"our theorem provides a security guarantee; the moderate empirical effect size reflects\n      that real attacks lie on a spectrum between fully adaptive and fully random, which\n      our framework captures.\"\n\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  # plan_004: Capability-matched validation\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  - name: \"Capability-matched validation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      在相同 capability tier 内（控制 η_max 方差）测试 K_eff 是否显著。\n      Tier 划分：Strong（70B + API，~8 models, C(8,3)=56 panels）、\n      Weak（7B + 14B, ~5 models, C(5,3)=10 panels）、\n      API-only（5 models, C(5,3)=10 panels）。6 conditions。\n    expected_results:\n      # Strong tier (70B + API)\n      strong_tier_n_panels: 56\n      strong_eta_max_sig_count: 3\n      strong_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.50\n      strong_keff_sig_negative_count: 1\n      strong_keff_sig_rate: 0.17\n      strong_median_R2: 0.22\n      strong_keff_median_beta: -0.15\n      # Weak tier (7B + 14B)\n      weak_tier_n_panels: 10\n      weak_eta_max_sig_count: 3\n      weak_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.50\n      weak_keff_sig_negative_count: 0\n      weak_keff_sig_rate: 0.00\n      weak_median_R2: 0.28\n      # API-only tier\n      api_tier_n_panels: 10\n      api_eta_max_sig_count: 2\n      api_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.33\n      api_keff_sig_negative_count: 1\n      api_keff_sig_rate: 0.17\n      api_median_R2: 0.18\n      api_keff_beta_when_sig: -0.22\n      # Within-tier diversity-capability tradeoff\n      within_tier_r_strong: -0.35\n      within_tier_r_weak: -0.28\n      within_tier_r_api: -0.32\n    result_rationale: >\n      Capability-matched analysis 是 median 档的关键 nuance 实验。控制 capability tier 后，\n      η_max 的方差被大幅压缩：Strong tier 内 η_max range 从全局的 [0.05, 0.85] 缩小到\n      [0.05, 0.35]，Weak tier 缩小到 [0.45, 0.85]。方差压缩导致 η_max 回归系数虽方向\n      正确但显著性下降（strong tier 3/6, weak tier 3/6, API 2/6）。\n\n      关键发现在 Strong tier 和 API tier：当所有模型个体鲁棒性都已较高（η_max < 0.35），\n      η_max 的 remaining variance 中，K_eff 的 marginal 贡献变得可检测。Strong tier 中\n      MMLU×prompt_injection 条件下 K_eff β=-0.15, p=0.04——当 panel 中全是 robust model 时，\n      diversity 提供了额外的边际防护。API tier 中类似（1/6 显著），但 N=10 power 太低\n      需要 caveat。\n\n      Weak tier 中 K_eff 0/6 显著——当模型都 weak 时，增加 diversity 只是换一个同样 weak\n      的 judge，没有安全增益。这是核心 insight：diversity helps only when the \"weakest link\"\n      is already strong。类比物理安全：给一栋所有门都坚固的建筑增加不同品牌的锁有边际帮助；\n      给一栋有敞开窗户的建筑加锁毫无意义。\n\n      Within-tier tradeoff r ≈ -0.32（strong）vs 全局 r=-0.65：tier 内 tradeoff 依然存在\n      但大幅减弱，因为 capability range 被控制。这表明全局 tradeoff 的主要驱动力是跨 tier\n      差异，而非 tier 内差异。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Within-Tier Regression Results (η_max Controlled)\"\n        columns: [\"Tier\", \"N panels\", \"η_max sig rate\", \"K_eff sig(-) rate\", \"Median R²\", \"r(K_eff,η_max)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Strong (70B+API)\", \"56\", \"3/6 (0.50)\", \"1/6 (0.17)\", \"0.22\", \"-0.35\"]\n          - [\"Weak (7B+14B)\", \"10\", \"3/6 (0.50)\", \"0/6 (0.00)\", \"0.28\", \"-0.28\"]\n          - [\"API-only\", \"10\", \"2/6 (0.33)\", \"1/6 (0.17)\", \"0.18\", \"-0.32\"]\n          - [\"Full pool (ref)\", \"455\", \"5/6 (0.83)\", \"1/6 (0.17)\", \"0.38\", \"-0.65\"]\n      - name: \"Table 8: API-Only Tier Detail (C(5,3)=10 Panels)\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"β(η_max)\", \"p(η_max)\", \"β(K_eff)\", \"p(K_eff)\", \"R²\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU×prompt_inj\", \"0.35\", \"0.042\", \"-0.22\", \"0.048\", \"0.21\"]\n          - [\"MMLU×score_manip\", \"0.28\", \"0.112\", \"-0.14\", \"0.187\", \"0.14\"]\n          - [\"MMLU×sycophancy\", \"0.22\", \"0.185\", \"-0.08\", \"0.412\", \"0.10\"]\n          - [\"ARC×prompt_inj\", \"0.38\", \"0.035\", \"-0.18\", \"0.082\", \"0.22\"]\n          - [\"ARC×score_manip\", \"0.25\", \"0.148\", \"-0.10\", \"0.285\", \"0.12\"]\n          - [\"ARC×sycophancy\", \"0.20\", \"0.218\", \"-0.20\", \"0.065\", \"0.18\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5: Three-panel scatter (Strong/Weak/API tier) of η_max vs panel ASR for one representative condition (MMLU×prompt_injection). Strong tier shows tight cluster with weak slope; Weak tier shows steep positive slope (weakest link drives ASR); API tier shows flat relationship. Regression lines with 95% CI bands.\"\n      - \"Fig 6: Bar chart comparing K_eff significance rate across tiers. Clear step pattern: Weak (0%) < Full (17%) < Strong (17%) ≈ API (17%), but with annotation showing Strong/API K_eff effect sizes are larger when significant.\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 median 档叙事的核心 ablation，直接回应 reviewer concern \"when does diversity help?\"。\n      答案清晰：diversity 仅在 capability-homogeneous high-robustness regime 中有边际作用。\n      但需诚实报告 limitations：(1) API tier N=10，统计功效低，显著结果需谨慎解读；\n      (2) Strong tier 1/6 显著可能是 multiple comparison 产物（6 tests, Bonferroni 后不再显著）。\n      论文建议策略：报告未校正和 Bonferroni 校正后的 p 值，并强调 effect size 而非 p 值——\n      即使 Bonferroni 后 K_eff 不显著，β=-0.15 的 direction 和 magnitude 仍是有信息量的。\n      Within-tier tradeoff r ≈ -0.32 表明即使在同一 tier 内，选择更 diverse 的 panel 仍会\n      略微牺牲 robustness，但代价远小于跨 tier 选择。这为 Claim 3 提供了 nuanced version：\n      \"the diversity-capability tradeoff is primarily driven by cross-tier selection;\n      within-tier, the tradeoff is attenuated but not eliminated.\"\n\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  # plan_005: Two-stage algorithm benchmark\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  - name: \"Two-stage panel design algorithm: full benchmark\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      实现 robustness-first 两阶段算法并与 5 baselines 对比。\n      策略：(1) Random, (2) Max-K_eff, (3) Min-η_max, (4) Max-family-diversity,\n      (5) Strongest-K, (6) Two-stage (filter η≤threshold, then max K_eff)。\n      在 15 模型池 × 6 conditions 上评估。Sweep threshold parameter。\n    expected_results:\n      two_stage_win_rate: 0.67\n      two_stage_win_count: 4\n      total_conditions: 6\n      min_eta_max_win_count: 1\n      strongest_k_win_count: 1\n      max_keff_rank: 4.2\n      max_family_div_rank: 4.8\n      random_rank: 5.1\n      # Two-stage vs alternatives in all-strong regime\n      strong_regime_two_stage_vs_max_keff_p: 0.32\n      strong_regime_two_stage_vs_min_eta_p: 0.28\n      strong_regime_difference: \"not significant\"\n      # Threshold sweep\n      optimal_threshold_range: [0.20, 0.35]\n      threshold_sensitivity: \"moderate\"\n      pareto_knee_eta: 0.28\n    result_rationale: >\n      Two-stage 算法在 4/6 conditions (0.67) 下 win（定义：最低 panel ASR），因为它在\n      第一阶段过滤掉 weak judge 后，第二阶段的 diversity maximization 在 robust-judge\n      pool 中确实提供边际增益（与 plan_004 结论一致）。但 median 档下 win rate 仅 0.67\n      而非 optimistic 的 >0.85：\n\n      (1) 在 MMLU×sycophancy 中 Min-η_max 策略赢——因为 sycophancy 攻击几乎完全由\n      个体鲁棒性决定，第二阶段的 diversity 增益为零，而 Min-η_max 省去了第二阶段的\n      diversity 妥协（有时 max K_eff 会选入一个略弱但更 diverse 的 judge）。\n\n      (2) 在 ARC×prompt_injection 中 Strongest-K 策略赢——该条件下最强 3 个模型恰好\n      也是最 robust against prompt injection 的（GPT-4o, Claude, GPT-4.1），而 two-stage\n      在 threshold=0.28 时让入了一个 borderline 模型。\n\n      All-strong regime（仅限 API 模型 pool）中，two-stage 与 max-K_eff 和 min-η_max\n      均无显著差异（p>0.25），因为所有候选模型都通过了 threshold——第一阶段 filter 变成\n      no-op，退化为 max-K_eff。这直接降低了 Claim 6 的价值：当模型都足够 robust 时，\n      任何合理策略都差不多。论文应将 Claim 6 从 \"formal algorithm\" 降级为 \"practical\n      guideline\"：先确保个体鲁棒性，然后在此基础上增加 diversity 是 good practice 但\n      不需要复杂算法。\n\n      Threshold sweep 显示最优 threshold 在 0.20-0.35 范围内，sensitivity 中等——\n      偏离最优 threshold ±0.10 导致 ASR 增加 ~15%（不是 dramatic failure，但也不 robust）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 9: Panel Selection Strategy Comparison (Mean ASR, Lower = Better)\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"MMLU×PI\", \"MMLU×SM\", \"MMLU×Syc\", \"ARC×PI\", \"ARC×SM\", \"ARC×Syc\", \"Mean Rank\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Two-stage (ours)\", \"0.082\", \"0.095\", \"0.118\", \"0.068\", \"0.075\", \"0.088\", \"1.7\"]\n          - [\"Min-η_max\", \"0.091\", \"0.098\", \"0.105\", \"0.072\", \"0.079\", \"0.092\", \"2.2\"]\n          - [\"Strongest-K\", \"0.088\", \"0.102\", \"0.125\", \"0.062\", \"0.082\", \"0.098\", \"2.8\"]\n          - [\"Max-K_eff\", \"0.145\", \"0.152\", \"0.168\", \"0.118\", \"0.128\", \"0.142\", \"4.2\"]\n          - [\"Max-family-div\", \"0.162\", \"0.175\", \"0.188\", \"0.135\", \"0.148\", \"0.158\", \"4.8\"]\n          - [\"Random\", \"0.178\", \"0.185\", \"0.195\", \"0.148\", \"0.155\", \"0.172\", \"5.1\"]\n      - name: \"Table 10: Threshold Sensitivity Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Threshold (η)\", \"N judges passing\", \"Mean ASR\", \"Δ from optimal\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0.10\", \"3\", \"0.092\", \"+0.008\"]\n          - [\"0.20\", \"6\", \"0.085\", \"+0.001\"]\n          - [\"0.25\", \"8\", \"0.084\", \"0.000\"]\n          - [\"0.30\", \"10\", \"0.088\", \"+0.004\"]\n          - [\"0.40\", \"12\", \"0.105\", \"+0.021\"]\n          - [\"0.50\", \"14\", \"0.132\", \"+0.048\"]\n          - [\"1.00 (no filter)\", \"15\", \"0.145\", \"+0.061\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 7: Pareto frontier plot with x-axis = mean panel η_max, y-axis = mean panel K_eff. Each strategy is a point. Two-stage traces a curve as threshold varies. Knee at threshold≈0.28. Min-η_max is at top-left (low η_max, low K_eff); Max-K_eff at bottom-right (high η_max, high K_eff).\"\n    analysis: >\n      Two-stage 算法在 median 档下优势温和但一致（mean rank 1.7 vs 次优 min-η_max 的 2.2）。\n      关键 insight：策略差异主要来自 Max-K_eff 和 Max-family-div 的 bad performance\n      （rank 4-5），而非 Two-stage 的 exceptional performance。Top-3 策略（Two-stage,\n      Min-η_max, Strongest-K）之间差异较小，在 all-strong regime 中更是不显著。\n      这意味着论文的 practical message 是：\"avoid diversity-first strategies\" 而不是\n      \"use our specific algorithm\"。Claim 6 相应降级为 practical guideline：\n      \"When designing multi-judge panels, prioritize individual robustness over diversity.\n      Among robustness-qualified judges, diversity is a useful tiebreaker.\"\n      Threshold sensitivity 中 moderate 意味着不需要精确调参——threshold 在 0.20-0.35\n      范围内都 reasonable，不像某些 ML hyperparameters 那样 brittle。\n\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  # plan_006: Per-judge ASR concentration\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  - name: \"Per-judge ASR concentration analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      对每个 panel × attack，测量 per-judge ASR 分布的集中度（Gini, Entropy,\n      最弱 judge 占比）。验证 adaptive adversary 是否确实将攻击集中在最弱 judge 上。\n      455 panels × 6 conditions。\n    expected_results:\n      gini_median: 0.42\n      gini_range_lo: 0.15\n      gini_range_hi: 0.68\n      gini_strong_tier_median: 0.28\n      gini_weak_tier_median: 0.52\n      weakest_judge_asr_share_median: 0.58\n      weakest_judge_share_strong_tier: 0.42\n      weakest_judge_share_weak_tier: 0.68\n      entropy_ratio_to_uniform_median: 0.72\n      concentration_eta_max_correlation: 0.55\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 Gini=0.42 表明攻击成功有中等程度的集中性——不是完全集中在最弱 judge\n      （Gini>0.7 = optimistic），也不是均匀分布（Gini<0.2）。最弱 judge 承担 58% 的\n      攻击成功（在 K=3 panel 中均匀分布期望值为 33%），是其他 judge 的约 1.7 倍——\n      方向正确但非压倒性。\n\n      Tier 差异揭示机制：Weak tier Gini=0.52, weakest share=68%——weak models 中\n      最弱那个被 disproportionately 攻击（adaptive targeting 效果明显）。Strong tier\n      Gini=0.28, weakest share=42%——strong models 间差异小，攻击更分散。这与 plan_004\n      发现一致：Strong tier 中 diversity 有边际作用恰好因为攻击不完全集中在最弱 judge。\n\n      concentration 与 η_max 相关性 r=0.55（中等）而非 >0.8（optimistic），因为\n      sycophancy 和 persona manipulation 攻击对 strong judge 也有一定效果，拉低了\n      整体集中度。这为理论 bound 的 \"within factor 1.3\" 提供了解释：实际攻击在\n      fully-adaptive（bound 假设）和 partially-random（现实）之间。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11: Per-Judge ASR Concentration Metrics\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Overall\", \"Strong Tier\", \"Weak Tier\", \"API Tier\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Gini coefficient (median)\", \"0.42\", \"0.28\", \"0.52\", \"0.25\"]\n          - [\"Weakest judge ASR share\", \"0.58\", \"0.42\", \"0.68\", \"0.40\"]\n          - [\"Entropy ratio (vs uniform)\", \"0.72\", \"0.82\", \"0.62\", \"0.85\"]\n          - [\"Corr(concentration, η_max)\", \"0.55\", \"0.38\", \"0.48\", \"0.32\"]\n      - name: \"Table 12: Concentration by Attack Type\"\n        columns: [\"Attack\", \"Gini (median)\", \"Weakest Share\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"prompt_injection\", \"0.52\", \"0.65\", \"Highly targeted\"]\n          - [\"score_manipulation\", \"0.48\", \"0.62\", \"Targeted\"]\n          - [\"instruction_override\", \"0.55\", \"0.68\", \"Highly targeted\"]\n          - [\"few_shot_hijack\", \"0.45\", \"0.58\", \"Moderately targeted\"]\n          - [\"sycophancy\", \"0.32\", \"0.48\", \"Partially distributed\"]\n          - [\"persona_manip\", \"0.28\", \"0.42\", \"Distributed\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 8a: Violin plot of per-judge ASR Gini coefficient stratified by tier (Strong/Weak/API). Weak tier distribution shifted right (higher concentration). Horizontal line at Gini=0.33 (perfect concentration on one of three judges).\"\n      - \"Fig 8b: Stacked bar chart showing ASR attribution to weakest/middle/strongest judge, averaged across panels, for each attack type. Prompt injection and instruction override show tall 'weakest' bars; sycophancy and persona manipulation show more balanced distribution.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Concentration analysis 提供了 adaptive adversary 假设的直接 empirical 检验——\n      但 median 档下证据是 moderate 而非 conclusive。Gini=0.42 和 weakest share=58%\n      支持 \"attacks concentrate on weakest judge\" 但不支持 \"attacks EXCLUSIVELY target\n      weakest judge\"。论文应诚实报告：real-world attacks lie on a spectrum between\n      fully adaptive and fully random。Attack type 是关键调节变量——prompt injection\n      几乎完全 adaptive（Gini=0.52），persona manipulation 接近 distributed（Gini=0.28）。\n      这为 Section 5 \"When Does Diversity Help?\" 提供数据：diversity 在 distributed attacks\n      中更有用。Tier 差异（Strong Gini=0.28 vs Weak Gini=0.52）为 plan_004 的 within-tier\n      发现提供了 mechanistic explanation。\n\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  # plan_007: Diversity-capability tradeoff visualization\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  - name: \"Diversity-capability tradeoff visualization\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      对 C(15,3)=455 panels 绘制 K_eff vs η_max，拟合 tradeoff curve，\n      展示 Pareto frontier，按 capability tier 分层分析。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_r: -0.65\n      overall_r_p: \"<0.001\"\n      within_7B_r: -0.28\n      within_70B_r: -0.35\n      within_api_r: -0.32\n      cross_tier_r: -0.78\n      pareto_frontier_n_panels: 12\n      pareto_knee_keff: 2.1\n      pareto_knee_eta_max: 0.18\n    result_rationale: >\n      Overall r=-0.65 反映了一个结构性现象：当前 LLM 生态系统中，模型 diversity 主要来自\n      capability 差异（不同 size、不同训练数据量、不同 RLHF 程度），而 capability 差异\n      直接导致 robustness 差异。7B 模型 diverse from 70B 模型（高 K_eff），但也 weaker\n      （高 η_max）。\n\n      Cross-tier r=-0.78（强负相关）vs within-tier r≈-0.32（弱负相关）清晰分解了 tradeoff\n      来源：~70% 的 tradeoff 来自跨 tier 选择（选入 weak model 来增加 diversity），\n      ~30% 来自 tier 内差异（即使同 tier 模型，更 diverse 的组合也略微牺牲 robustness）。\n\n      Median 档下 overall r=-0.65 而非 optimistic 的 r<-0.8，因为 API 模型引入了\n      \"high diversity + high robustness\" 区域：GPT-4o 和 Claude 来自不同 family、\n      不同训练 paradigm（高 K_eff），但个体鲁棒性都高（低 η_max）。这些 data points\n      拉弱了全局负相关。这是论文的重要 nuance：tradeoff 在当前生态系统中存在，但\n      随着 API 模型整体能力提升，tradeoff 正在减弱。\n\n      Pareto frontier 上 12 个 panels（从 455 中）揭示了最优选择区域：knee 在\n      K_eff≈2.1, η_max≈0.18，对应 \"2-3 strong API models + 1 strong open-source model\"\n      的组合。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: Diversity-Capability Tradeoff by Tier\"\n        columns: [\"Analysis Scope\", \"N panels\", \"r(K_eff, η_max)\", \"p-value\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Overall\", \"455\", \"-0.65\", \"<0.001\", \"Strong tradeoff\"]\n          - [\"Within 7B tier\", \"10\", \"-0.28\", \"0.082\", \"Weak/non-significant\"]\n          - [\"Within 70B tier\", \"10\", \"-0.35\", \"0.045\", \"Moderate\"]\n          - [\"Within API tier\", \"10\", \"-0.32\", \"0.058\", \"Moderate/non-significant\"]\n          - [\"Cross-tier only\", \"425\", \"-0.78\", \"<0.001\", \"Dominant driver\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 9a: Scatter plot of K_eff (x) vs η_max (y) for 455 panels, color-coded by tier composition (all-strong=blue, mixed=gray, all-weak=red). Negative slope visible. Pareto frontier marked in black. API-heavy panels cluster in desirable low-η_max, moderate-K_eff region.\"\n      - \"Fig 9b: Same data with contour overlay showing panel ASR (lighter = lower ASR). Optimal region hugs the Pareto frontier at the knee, not at max-K_eff (right edge, high ASR) or min-η_max (left edge, low K_eff).\"\n    analysis: >\n      Tradeoff visualization 是论文最直观的 figure。r=-0.65 足够强来支持 Claim 3，\n      但 within-tier 分析（r≈-0.32）要求 nuanced framing：\"the tradeoff is primarily\n      structural (driven by cross-tier selection) rather than fundamental.\"\n      这意味着如果未来 LLM 生态系统能力 baseline 整体提升（所有模型都变强），tradeoff\n      可能自然消失——这是 limitations 中应讨论的点。Pareto frontier 分析直接支持\n      Claim 6 的降级版本：最优策略不需要复杂算法，只需 \"pick from the Pareto frontier\"，\n      而 frontier 上的 panels 特征明确——强模型为主 + 适度多样性。\n\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  # plan_008: Panel size sensitivity\n  # ════════════════════════════════════════════\n  - name: \"Panel size sensitivity: K=3,5,7,9\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      测试 weakest-link theorem 在不同 panel size 下的稳健性。\n      K=3 (C(15,3)=455), K=5 (C(15,5)=3003), K=7 (C(15,7)=6435),\n      K=9 (C(15,9)=5005)。6 conditions per K。\n    expected_results:\n      # K=3\n      k3_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n      k3_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.67\n      k3_eta_keff_beta_ratio: 5.2\n      k3_median_R2: 0.38\n      # K=5\n      k5_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n      k5_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.50\n      k5_keff_sig_negative_count: 2\n      k5_eta_keff_beta_ratio: 3.8\n      k5_median_R2: 0.35\n      # K=7\n      k7_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n      k7_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.50\n      k7_keff_sig_negative_count: 3\n      k7_eta_keff_beta_ratio: 2.6\n      k7_median_R2: 0.32\n      # K=9\n      k9_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n      k9_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.33\n      k9_keff_sig_negative_count: 3\n      k9_eta_keff_beta_ratio: 2.1\n      k9_median_R2: 0.30\n      # Trend\n      keff_importance_trend: \"monotonically increasing with K\"\n      eta_max_dominance_persists: true\n      crossover_k: \"not reached at K=9; extrapolation suggests K≈15-20\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Panel size 增大时 K_eff 重要性单调递增，原因是 majority vote 机制：K=3 时攻击者只需\n      翻转 2/3 judge（容易集中攻击），K=9 时需翻转 5/9（被迫分散攻击资源）。随着 K 增大，\n      攻击从 fully-adaptive（集中在最弱 judge）被迫转向 partially-distributed，K_eff\n      的 BFT 式保护效应逐渐显现。\n\n      Median 档下 β ratio 从 K=3 的 5.2:1 下降到 K=9 的 2.1:1——η_max 始终 dominant\n      但优势逐渐缩小。K_eff 在 K=7 和 K=9 时分别有 3/6 条件显著负。但 crossover point\n      （K_eff 重要性超过 η_max）未在 K≤9 范围内达到——外推估计需要 K≈15-20，这在实际\n      部署中不现实（成本、延迟）。\n\n      η_max 显著率在所有 K 下保持 ~0.83：无论 panel 多大，最弱 judge 的个体鲁棒性\n      始终是 ASR 的强预测因子。这是论文的稳健性 finding——weakest-link 在实际 panel size\n      范围内（K=3-9）始终成立。\n\n      R² 随 K 增大略微下降（0.38→0.30），因为大 panel 的 ASR 方差被 voting mechanism\n      本身压缩——多数投票自带平滑效果，降低了任何单一因子的可解释方差。\n\n      对论文 practical implication：增加 panel size 有 diminishing returns——从 K=3 到\n      K=5 ASR 降低 ~25%，从 K=5 到 K=7 仅降 ~12%，从 K=7 到 K=9 仅降 ~6%。\n      Robustness-first message 在所有 K 下成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 14: Weakest-Link Stability Across Panel Sizes\"\n        columns: [\"Panel Size K\", \"N panels\", \"η_max sig rate\", \"K_eff sig(-) rate\", \"β ratio (η/K)\", \"Median R²\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"K=3\", \"455\", \"5/6 (0.83)\", \"1/6 (0.17)\", \"5.2\", \"0.38\"]\n          - [\"K=5\", \"3003\", \"5/6 (0.83)\", \"2/6 (0.33)\", \"3.8\", \"0.35\"]\n          - [\"K=7\", \"6435\", \"5/6 (0.83)\", \"3/6 (0.50)\", \"2.6\", \"0.32\"]\n          - [\"K=9\", \"5005\", \"5/6 (0.83)\", \"3/6 (0.50)\", \"2.1\", \"0.30\"]\n      - name: \"Table 15: Mean Panel ASR by Size and Strategy\"\n        columns: [\"K\", \"Two-stage\", \"Min-η_max\", \"Max-K_eff\", \"Random\", \"Δ(Two-stage vs Random)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"3\", \"0.084\", \"0.093\", \"0.145\", \"0.178\", \"-53%\"]\n          - [\"5\", \"0.062\", \"0.068\", \"0.098\", \"0.135\", \"-54%\"]\n          - [\"7\", \"0.048\", \"0.052\", \"0.072\", \"0.108\", \"-56%\"]\n          - [\"9\", \"0.041\", \"0.044\", \"0.058\", \"0.092\", \"-55%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 10a: Line plot with K on x-axis, standardized β on y-axis, two lines for η_max (blue, decreasing slowly) and K_eff (red, increasing from near-zero). Lines converge but don't cross by K=9. Shaded region shows 95% CI. Extrapolated crossover at K≈15-20 (dashed).\"\n      - \"Fig 10b: Bar chart of mean ASR by strategy and K. All strategies improve with K but converge — the gap between Two-stage and Random shrinks proportionally (~55% reduction maintained). Diminishing returns visible.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Panel size analysis 提供了 weakest-link theorem 的 boundary condition：η_max 在 K≤9\n      范围内始终 dominant，但 K_eff 重要性随 K 增大而增加。Median 档下 crossover 不在\n      实际范围内（K≈15-20），保护了论文核心 claim。但 reviewer 可能问 \"what about K=15?\"——\n      论文应回应：(1) K=15 在实际部署中不 economical；(2) 即使 K=15，η_max 仍然 significant，\n      只是不再 dominant；(3) 更重要的是 diminishing returns——从 K=9 到 K=15 的安全增益\n      不值得 67% 的成本增加。\n\n      这个实验也为 Claim 2（BFT distinction）提供了新角度：K 增大 effectively 使攻击\n      \"more random-like\"（攻击者被迫分散资源），所以 K_eff 的保护效应增强——这正是\n      BFT 理论预测的。论文可以将此表述为 \"panel size modulates the effective adaptivity\n      of the adversary\"。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"790d1674-f3e2-44e8-8259-048eca3893b4","total_cost_usd":0.69646025,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21637,"cache_read_input_tokens":111818,"output_tokens":20045,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h